  "the STE x_q = x + (Decode(q) - x).detach(): identity gradient, contributes no scalar",
  "the pull/commitment codebook terms built on sg(r_l) and sg(c_{l,k*}): their stop-gradient copies are constants of the fixed instance and need state not carried in the argument list"
